"Dr. Vikram Patel: 'Indeed. Ultimately, durable development depends on building what political economists call 'capable, accountable states': institutions strong enough to deliver public goods and long-term strategic vision, yet constrained by democratic transparency, judicial independence, and active citizen participation so power serves the common good rather than narrow privilege.'"
